## Workspace vs principal (mental model)

| Concept | `alliance_hq_session` without `hq_user_id` | After sign-in |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Purpose** | Browser workspace (Ashed cred staging, pairing, job correlation) | Workspace + linked HQ user |
| **RBAC** | **Deny all** | Evaluate memberships + maintainer flag |
| **NextAuth** | May be absent | Required for invite accept and many identity-bound flows |

Do not document anonymous workspace rows as “allow-all until reconnect” invariants.

